// Windows resources for Antares.exe. The icon (the Ishiman Heavy Cruiser, built by
// scripts/make_icon.py) is the exe's only icon, so Explorer and shortcuts show it. Its name,
// GLFW_ICON, is the one GLFW loads for the game window's class (win32_window.c), so the window's
// title bar and taskbar button show it too.

GLFW_ICON ICON "icon/antares.ico"
